\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.2}{\ignorespaces Left: the largest ratio of adjacent element sizes of a 20-element power-law partition against the exponent. Right: the partition for a target growth ratio of 1.2, against a uniform one.\relax }}{10}{figure.caption.16}%
