\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.3}{\ignorespaces Convergence of the first cantilever frequency of the Euler--Bernoulli beam (left) and of the tip deflection of the Reissner beam (right) with the element size, with the observed order.\relax }}{19}{figure.caption.37}%
